	"\"The ones you cannot see - %s - will come out of the %s, when the drums have beaten about %d times.\"": "“看不见的那些——%s——会从%s出来，大约在鼓敲了 %d 下的时候。”",
	"\"Tell your men what I told you. Men who know where death stands hold their shields higher.\"": "“把我说的告诉你的人。知道死亡站在哪儿的人，盾会举得更高。”",
	"He looks at the carts. \"At this pace you reach the Great Altar %d measures short. That is not an omen. That is arithmetic.\"": "他看了看车队。“照这个速度，你到大祭场时会差 %d 斗。这不是预兆，是算术。”",
	"\"The forest remembers the seeds. A third warband waits in the trees. It was always going to.\"": "“森林记得那些种子。第三支战团等在树林里。这是早就注定的。”",
	"The omen": "预兆",
	"The road is held": "道路被占",
	"%s bar the way.": "%s挡住了去路。",
	" About %d of them in all.": " 总共大约 %d 人。",
	" You cannot tell how many. The altar might have told you.": " 你看不出有多少人。祭坛也许能告诉你。",
	" Their hidden force will strike from your %s.": " 他们的伏兵会从你的%s杀出。",
	"LEFT": "左侧",
	"RIGHT": "右侧",
	" Scouts report movement on the flanks, but not which one.": " 斥候报告两翼有动静，但不知道是哪一边。",
	"\n\nYou have %d men in %d regiments. Regiments that survive are whole again tomorrow; the dead are not.": "\n\n你有 %d 人，分成 %d 个团。活下来的团明天就能补满；死去的人不会回来。",
	"Raise the standard  (fight)": "举起军旗（开战）",
	"Left %d measures of grain on the road rather than fight for it.": "留下 %d 斗粮在路上，没有为它而战。",
	"The toll": "过路费",
	"They let the column through between two lines of spears. Nobody on either side says anything.": "他们让队伍从两排长矛中间穿过。双方都一言不发。",
	"Abandon half the grain as a toll and slip past  (-%d grain)": "丢下一半粮食当过路费，悄悄通过（-%d 粮）",
	"Not yet": "还没准备好",
	"Rode past %s without a word.": "一言不发地从%s旁边骑过。",
	"Ride on without answering  (they will be gone when you return)": "不回答，继续骑行（你回来时他们已经走了）",
	"Vicus Aquila": "维库斯·阿奎拉",
	"Collected Vicus Aquila's arrears in full under lawful writ. Sixty people, five measures left.": "依法按敕令收齐了维库斯·阿奎拉的欠粮。六十个人，剩下五斗。",
	"It is done before noon. It is entirely legal. A child follows the carts as far as the milestone.": "中午前就办完了。完全合法。一个孩子跟着车队一直走到里程碑。",
	"Took half from Vicus Aquila. Wrote that it was paid in full. That is a capital crime.": "从维库斯·阿奎拉拿了一半。写成“已全部缴清”。这是死罪。",
	"The headman watches you write the lie and says nothing. If an auditor ever compares the ledgers, it is your neck.": "村长看着你写下谎言，一言不发。要是哪个审计官比对两本账，掉的是你的脑袋。",
	"Gave Vicus Aquila eight measures of the Emperor's grain. Six of their sons joined the column.": "把皇帝的八斗粮给了维库斯·阿奎拉。村里六个儿子加入了队伍。",
	"Six young men fall in behind the standard. Now they are yours to feed, and yours to bring back.": "六个年轻人跟在了军旗后面。现在要由你来养活他们，也要由你把他们带回来。",
	"An imperial village, on your own side of the border. The ledger says they owe 35 measures. The headman shows you the granary: it holds perhaps 40, and there are sixty people.\n\"You have the writ,\" he says. \"I can read.\"": "一个帝国村庄，就在边境你自己这一边。账本说他们欠 35 斗。村长带你看粮仓：大概有 40 斗，而村里有六十个人。\n“你有敕令，”他说，“我识字。”",
	"Collect in full.  +35 grain, +10 denarii": "全部收齐。+35 粮，+10 金",
	"Take half and write 'paid in full'.  +17 grain": "拿一半，写成“已缴清”。+17 粮",
	"Leave them a tithe of yours.  -8 grain, 6 villagers enlist": "把你的粮留给他们一成。-8 粮，6 个村民入伍",
	"The Thorncrown seed-keepers": "荆冠的守种人",
	"Took the Thorncrown's last seed as tax. There will be no planting there in spring.": "把荆冠最后的种子当税收走了。那里春天不会有播种了。",
	"They do not resist. As the carts roll, horns sound from three directions in the trees - not an attack. A count.": "他们没有反抗。车队走动时，树林里三个方向响起号角——不是进攻，是在点数。",
	"Thorncrown: their seed was left in the ground.": "荆冠：他们的种子留在了土里。",
	"Left the Thorncrown seed untouched and paid for passage. The Emperor's ledger is 45 measures short for it.": "没有动荆冠的种子，还付了过路钱。皇帝的账本因此少了 45 斗。",
	"The matron sends a boy to walk with your scouts. He shows them exactly where the next warband waits, and from which side. You receive cured hides, and no grain at all.": "女族长派一个男孩跟着你的斥候。他准确地指出下一支战团在哪里、从哪边来。你得到了熟皮，一粒粮也没有。",
	"Took a third of the Thorncrown seed. Told myself it was a compromise.": "拿走了荆冠三分之一的种子。告诉自己这是折中。",
	"Enough left to plant a thin field. Enough taken that they will remember your face.": "剩下的够种一小片地。拿走的够让他们记住你的脸。",
	"The ledger lists 45 measures of 'grain tax' from the forest tribes. What they bring out, on a bark tray, is seed. All of it. A matron in a bone mask sets it down and steps back.\n\"If you take it, we eat this winter's bark and plant nothing in spring.\"": "账本列着森林部族 45 斗“粮税”。他们端出来的，放在树皮托盘上的，是种子。全部的种子。一个戴骨面具的女族长把它放下，退后一步。\n“你拿走它，我们这个冬天就吃树皮，春天什么也种不了。”",
	"Seize the seed.  +45 grain, +Seed Grain offering; the forest turns hostile": "夺走种子。+45 粮，+种粮贡品；森林会与你为敌",
	"Leave the seed; pay for passage.  ": "留下种子，付过路钱。 ",
	"-Salt Cone": "-盐锥",
	"-20 denarii": "-20 金",
	"; their scouts reveal the next battle": "；他们的斥候会透露下一场战斗",
	"Take a third and call it the tax.  +15 grain": "拿三分之一，就当是税。+15 粮",
	"The Frostbay oath-stone": "霜湾誓石",
	"Frostbay Oathshields": "霜湾誓盾",
	"Frostbay: the Ancestral Horn returned.": "霜湾：先祖号角已归还。",
	"Gave the Emperor's offering back to the people it was taken from. The ledger is one offering short.": "把皇帝的贡品还给了被夺走它的人。账本少了一件贡品。",
	"They carry it away wrapped in a cloak, like a child. Sixteen huge men fall in at the rear of your column with dried fish for twenty.": "他们用斗篷把它裹起来带走，像抱着一个孩子。十六个巨汉跟在你队伍后面，还带着够二十人吃的鱼干。",
	"Frostbay: return the Ancestral Horn at journey's end.": "霜湾：旅途终点时归还先祖号角。",
	"Swore on the Frostbay stone to return the horn. I still carry it, and it is still on the Emperor's list.": "对着霜湾誓石发誓会归还号角。号角还在我手里，也还在皇帝的清单上。",
	"You get the regiment today and keep the offering - until the Great Altar, where one of the two promises you have made about this horn will have to break.": "今天你得到了这个团，也留着这件贡品——直到大祭场，到时你为这支号角许下的两个承诺必有一个要破。",
	"Refused Frostbay their horn.": "拒绝把号角还给霜湾。",
	"The speaker nods slowly, as if you had confirmed something. The shield-wall opens. There are more of them further up the road now.": "发言者缓缓点头，像是确认了什么。盾墙让开了。前面的路上，他们的人更多了。",
	"A shield-wall waits across the road, not hostile yet. Their speaker is a head taller than your horse.\n\"You carry our fathers' horn in your baggage, listed as 'offering'. Return it and our oathshields march with you. Burn it in the south and we will not forget which officer carried it there.\"": "一道盾墙横在路上，暂时没有敌意。他们的发言者比你的马还高一头。\n“你的行李里装着我们祖先的号角，记成了‘贡品’。还给我们，我们的誓盾就跟你走。要是在南方烧了它，我们不会忘记是哪个军官把它带去的。”",
	"Hand it over now.  -Ancestral Horn; an Oathshield regiment and 20 grain": "现在就交出去。-先祖号角；得到一个誓盾团和 20 粮",
	"Swear on the stone to return it at journey's end.  Oathshields join now": "对着誓石发誓在终点归还。誓盾现在就加入",
	"Refuse. The horn is imperial property.  More of them will hold the road": "拒绝。号角是帝国财产。更多人会来挡路",
	"A veiled envoy": "蒙面的使者",
	"Broke the Emperor's seal for the Duskviolet Court. That is treason. I can now see what is coming.": "为暮紫巫庭打开了皇帝的封印。这是叛国。我现在能看见将要发生的事。",
	"The clerk copies quickly. In return the astrologer gives you a marked calendar: where and when each enemy on your road will strike. The wax will not go back on.": "书记员抄得很快。作为回报，占星师给了你一本标好的历书：路上每个敌人会在何时何地出击。封蜡再也贴不回去了。",
	"Let the Duskviolet seal away what the men knew of %s, for a codex.": "让暮紫封走了士兵们关于%s的记忆，换来一本典籍。",
	"The astrologer touches brazier smoke to your centurions' foreheads. By evening nobody in camp can remember how %s was drilled. You hold a codex the Empire will accept as an offering.": "占星师把火盆的烟抹在你百夫长们的额头上。到了晚上，营里没人记得%s是怎么操练的。你得到了一本帝国会当作贡品接收的典籍。",
	"Refused the Duskviolet envoy.": "拒绝了暮紫使者。",
	"\"Then walk blind,\" she says, without malice. The brazier goes out by itself.": "“那就瞎着走吧，”她说，没有恶意。火盆自己熄灭了。",
	"A Duskviolet astrologer waits by the road with a brazier and a clerk. \"We keep the calendar. We know what this year's omen was, and why your King forbade its reading. You carry sealed orders with the Emperor's mark. Let my clerk copy them - or pay in the other coin we take.\"": "一个暮紫占星师带着火盆和书记员等在路边。“我们掌管历法。我们知道今年的凶兆是什么，也知道你们的国王为什么禁止宣读。你带着盖有皇帝印记的密令。让我的书记员抄一份——或者付我们收的另一种钱。”",
	"Break the imperial seal.  Every future battle is fully foretold": "打开帝国封印。之后每场战斗都会被完整预言",
	"Pay in memory.  Lose a learned doctrine; gain the Sealed Codex (offering)": "用记忆支付。失去一项已学的军学；获得封印典籍（贡品）",
	"Refuse both.": "都拒绝。",
	"Three men in the grain cart": "粮车里的三个人",
	"Had three deserters killed in front of the column. One was the signifer's brother.": "在全队面前处决了三个逃兵。其中一个是旗手的兄弟。",
	"It takes less time than striking a tent. The drill is very sharp the next morning.": "比拆一顶帐篷还快。第二天早上的操练格外利落。",
	"Pardoned three deserters.": "赦免了三个逃兵。",
	"They go back to their files. Some men look relieved. Some are doing arithmetic about sacks and boots.": "他们回到了队列里。有些人松了口气。有些人在算粮袋和靴子。",
	"Sent three men home with letters. Called it a courier detail.": "写了信，把三个人送回家。说是派去送信。",
	"You write to the fort that grain is coming. You write it as if you knew.": "你写信给要塞，说粮食就要到了。写得好像你真的知道一样。",
	"The night watch drags three of your own out of the baggage: a sack of grain each, boots packed for the road home. One of them is the standard-bearer's brother. The column is watching to see what a promise from you is worth.": "守夜的人从辎重里拖出三个自己人：每人一袋粮，靴子打包好准备回家。其中一个是旗手的兄弟。全队都在看，你的承诺到底值多少。",
	"Execute them before the standard.  -3 men; +15% damage next battle": "在军旗前处决他们。-3 人；下场战斗伤害 +15%",
	"Pardon them. The grain is already eaten.  -6 grain": "赦免他们。粮已经吃掉了。-6 粮",
	"Send them home with letters for the fort.  -3 men": "让他们带着信回要塞。-3 人",
	"Refugees on the road": "路上的难民",
	"Fed forty strangers with grain that belongs to the Emperor and the fort.": "用属于皇帝和要塞的粮喂了四十个陌生人。",
	"Four of the younger ones ask for spears. The old woman keeps her amber.": "其中四个年轻人要了长矛。老妇人留下了她的琥珀。",
	"Bought a village's whole wealth for three measures of grain.": "用三斗粮买下了一个村子的全部财富。",
	"A fair price, in a famine. She counts the loaves twice.": "饥荒年里，这算公道的价。她把面包数了两遍。",
	"Had the rear guard turn refugees away with spear-butts.": "让后卫用矛杆把难民赶走了。",
	"They stop following by nightfall. The column moves faster.": "到傍晚他们就不再跟着了。队伍走得更快。",
	"Forty people with handcarts have been following the dust of your column for a day, because soldiers mean food. An old woman holds up a lump of amber the size of a fist - everything her village owned.": "四十个推着手推车的人跟着你队伍扬起的尘土走了一天，因为有士兵的地方就有吃的。一个老妇人举起拳头大的一块琥珀——那是她村子拥有的一切。",
	"Feed them.  -8 grain; four of them take the oath": "喂饱他们。-8 粮；其中四人宣誓入伍",
	"Take the amber for a day's bread.  -3 grain, +Amber": "用一天的面包换琥珀。-3 粮，+琥珀",
	"Drive them off the road.": "把他们赶下路。",
	"The column starved on the road. Nobody reached the Great Altar.": "队伍饿死在路上。没有人走到大祭场。",
	"The road divides": "道路分岔",
	"You have only %d - men will die on the march.": "你只有 %d——行军中会有人饿死。",
	"Night. A day's march either way; the column will eat %d grain. %s": "夜里。往哪边走都是一天路程；队伍要吃 %d 粮。%s",
	"There is only one road left. Torches on the hill ahead: the Great Altar, and the Emperor's auditors.": "只剩一条路了。前方山上有火把：大祭场，还有皇帝的审计官。",
	"Go up to the Great Altar": "登上大祭场",
	"Altars here answer to %s.": "这里的祭坛回应%s。",
	"You have dealt with them before.": "你和他们打过交道。",
	"They have something the ledger wants.": "他们有账本想要的东西。",
	"Scouts: about %d hold that road, not counting what hides. Recruits there: %d.": "斥候：约有 %d 人守着那条路，不算藏起来的。那里能招到的兵：%d。",
	"March  (%s)": "出发（%s）",
	"BEGIN  [Enter]": "开始  [Enter]",
	"Left-click or drag: select.  Right-click: move / attack (drag to set facing).  Space: pause.": "左键或拖动：选择。右键：移动/攻击（拖动设定朝向）。空格：暂停。",
	"R Retreat": "R 撤退",
	"H Halt": "H 停止",
	"V Volley": "V 齐射",
	"%s     yours %d   theirs %d in sight": "%s     我方 %d   视野内敌方 %d",
	"\nDEPLOY: drag banners inside the marked ground, pick formations, then begin.": "\n部署：把旗帜拖到标记区域内，选好阵型，然后开始。",
	"\nOMEN: their hidden force comes from the %s at about %d.  now %d": "\n预兆：他们的伏兵会从%s杀出，大约在 %d 时。  现在 %d",
	"\nSomething is moving beyond the flanks. You do not know which one.   %d": "\n两翼之外有东西在动。你不知道是哪一边。   %d",
	"\nPAUSED - orders can still be given.": "\n已暂停——仍可下达命令。",
	"  REFORMING %.1fs (cannot attack)": "  变阵中 %.1f 秒（无法攻击）",
	"  formation change ready in %ds": "  %d 秒后可以变阵",
	"  RESTING - healing": "  休整中——回复生命",
	"  RETREATING": "  撤退中",
	"  volley %s": "  齐射 %s",
	"READY": "就绪",
	"%ds": "%d 秒",
	"%s%s  %d/%d men  kills %d  [%s: %s]%s": "%s%s  %d/%d 人  击杀 %d  [%s：%s]%s",
	"RESUME [Space]": "继续 [空格]",
	"PAUSE  [Space]": "暂停  [空格]",
	"CHARGE": "冲锋",
	"TESTUDO BROKEN": "龟甲被冲散",
	"OUT OF RANGE": "超出射程",
	"SHATTER": "碎裂",
	"CRIT": "暴击",
	"PROMOTED": "晋升",
	"DESTROYED": "全灭",
	"ROUTED": "溃逃",
	"AMBUSH!": "伏击！",
	"   PROMOTED": "   晋升",
	"%s - destroyed": "%s - 全灭",
	"%s - %d stand, %d fell%s%s": "%s - %d 人还站着，%d 人倒下%s%s",
	"  (%d carried back by the medici)": "  （军医救回了 %d 人）",
	"The field is yours": "战场是你的了",
	"The standard has fallen": "军旗倒下了",
	"Held %s. %d of ours did not get up.": "守住了%s。我们有 %d 人没能再站起来。",
	"The %s were destroyed to a man.": "%s全军覆没。",
	"\n\nTaken from the field: %d denarii, %d grain, %s.": "\n\n从战场上缴获：%d 金，%d 粮，%s。",
	"\nTheir stores burned for us: +15 grain.": "\n烧掉了他们的存粮：+15 粮。",
	"\nRegiments that still stand will be whole again by morning. The dead stay in the ledger.": "\n还站着的团明早就能补满。死者留在账本里。",
	"\nDecimation: %d of our own, chosen by lot.": "\n什一抽杀：抽签处决了 %d 个自己人。",
	"The standard fell on %s.": "军旗倒在了%s。",
	"The standard fell on %s, day %d. No grain went home.": "军旗倒在了%s，第 %d 天。没有一粒粮运回家。",
	"\n\nNobody is left to carry the grain.": "\n\n没有人剩下来运粮了。",
	"Return to the column": "回到队伍",
	"The ledger closes": "账本合上了",
	"OMEN: FLANK": "预兆：侧袭",
	"VOLLEY": "齐射",
	"The Great Altar": "大祭场",
	"Auditors with wax tablets wait at the foot of the steps. Behind them, more cattle than you have ever seen in one place.\n\nThe ledger demands %d grain and %d offerings. Your carts hold %d grain and %d offerings. Meet it, and the fort is granted a season's ration.": "拿着蜡板的审计官等在台阶下。他们身后的牛群比你一辈子见过的都多。\n\n账本要求 %d 粮和 %d 件贡品。你的车上有 %d 粮和 %d 件贡品。交够了，要塞就能领到一季口粮。",
	"\n\nA Frostbay runner stands apart from the crowd, watching your baggage. You swore on their stone.": "\n\n一个霜湾信使站在人群之外，盯着你的辎重。你对着他们的石头发过誓。",
	"Deliver everything the ledger asks for.": "交付账本要求的一切。",
	"Deliver the rest - but put the horn in the Frostbay runner's hands first.": "交付其余的——但先把号角放到霜湾信使手里。",
	"Turn the carts around. The grain goes home; the Emperor gets nothing.": "掉转车头。粮食运回家，皇帝什么也得不到。",
	"Day %d. %d men marched behind the standard. %d did not come back.": "第 %d 天。%d 人跟随军旗出发。%d 人没有回来。",
	"The Emperor's ledger records the column as 'not delivered'.": "皇帝的账本把这支队伍记为“未交付”。",
	"A horn, somewhere in fog.": "雾中某处，一声号角。",
	"The runner took the horn without a word and was gone before the auditors looked up.": "信使一言不发地接过号角，在审计官抬头之前就不见了。",
	"You delivered nothing. %d measures of grain went north in your own carts.": "你什么也没交付。%d 斗粮装在你自己的车上往北去了。",
	"The Emperor's ledger records you as a deserter with a baggage train.": "皇帝的账本把你记为一个带着辎重的逃兵。",
	"The fort ate thin bread until spring. Most of them lived.": "要塞靠稀薄的面包熬到了春天。大多数人活了下来。",
	"It was not enough grain for that many people. The gates were opened anyway.": "这点粮养不活那么多人。城门还是开着。",
	"A shield wall at a ford, facing south.": "渡口的一道盾墙，面朝南方。",
	"Delivered: %d of %d grain, %d of %d offerings.": "已交付：%d / %d 粮，%d / %d 件贡品。",
	"The auditors pressed their seal. A season's ration was sent to the fort.": "审计官盖上了印。一季口粮送往了要塞。",
	"Nobody looks closely at the books of an officer who met his quota.": "没人会细查一个完成了定额的军官的账。",
	"The auditors accepted what there was and granted nothing. Short is short.": "审计官收下了现有的东西，什么也没给。差了就是差了。",
	"One of them set two ledgers side by side for a long time.": "其中一个把两本账并排放着看了很久。",
	"One of them turned your orders over and looked at the seal.": "其中一个把你的命令翻过来，看了看封印。",
	"The Great Sacrifice was held. Whether it worked, the next harvest will say.": "大祭举行了。灵不灵，要看下一季收成。",
	"A wet red cord in a priest's hands.": "祭司手里一根湿红绳。",
	"The ledger has %d entries in your hand. Nobody asks to read it.": "账本上有 %d 条你亲手写的记录。没人要求看。",
	"What you promised to protect - did you protect it?": "你承诺要保护的——你保护住了吗？",
	"Close": "关闭",
	"[Enter] march again     [L] read the ledger": "[Enter] 再次出征     [L] 阅读账本",
	"Four powers ring the inner sea. Each believes the gods are owed something different - and that the others are paying it wrong.": "内海四周环伺着四股势力。每一方都相信神明在索要不同的东西——也都认为，别人献错了。",
	"The harvests failed three years running. The King called a Great Sacrifice, and sent his ledgers out to collect for it: grain, herds, and holy things.": "收成连续三年歉收。国王宣布举行一场大祭，派出账官四处征收：粮食、牲畜，还有圣物。",
	"The north says the Empire carried off its ancestors' horn. The western forest is being cut for altars. The east keeps the calendar and will not publish this year's omen. And miners say the ground under the old altar rings hollow.": "北方说帝国夺走了先祖的号角。西方的森林被砍去建祭坛。东方掌管历法，却不肯公开今年的凶兆。而矿工说，古祭坛底下的地是空的。",
	"Cassius commands a border fort. When the refugees came he opened the gates and promised: while the standard stands, you may stay.": "卡西乌斯驻守一座边境要塞。难民来时，他打开城门，许下承诺：只要军旗还在，你们就能留下。",
	"The granary is nearly empty. The Empire's answer was a writ: reopen the north road, collect what the provinces owe, deliver it to the Great Altar - and your fort will be fed.\n\nSeventy men. Forty-five measures of grain. Go.": "粮仓快空了。帝国的回复是一道敕令：重开北路，收齐各地所欠，送往大祭场——你的要塞就能分到口粮。\n\n七十人，四十五斗粮。出发。",
